        rules: {
          objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest 5-card poker hand at showdown, or by forcing all other players to fold.',
          gameplay: '1. **Ante**: All players ante. 2. **Initial Deal**: 2 cards down, 1 card up to each player. 3. **First Betting Round**: High card showing acts first. 4. **Fourth Street**: Another upcard dealt; betting round. 5. **Fifth Street**: Another upcard dealt; betting round. 6. **Sixth Street**: Another upcard dealt; betting round. 7. **Seventh Street**: Final downcard dealt; last betting round. 8. **Showdown**: Best 5-card hand wins.',
